# Simple Comprehensive Example (current parser-safe style)

Load examples/sample_contract.txt

Document must contain liability clause
Document must contain termination clause

Find liability cap and save as liability_cap
Find contract value and save as contract_value

review_needed equals false

If liability_cap is missing
  review_needed equals true
Otherwise
  review_needed equals false

If review_needed is true
  Route contract to legal_review_queue
Otherwise
  Route contract to approved_queue
